OL,5,T5FVIOLENT PROTESTS AFTER HANI MURDER Tj
OL,6,T5GViolence has been spreading in     Tj
OL,7,T5GSouth Africa following the murder  Tj
OL,8,T5Gof Communist party chief Chris HaniTj
OL,9,T5                                     j
OL,10,T5FGunmen have opened fire on two carsTj
OL,11,T5Fcarrying white civilians on the    Tj
OL,12,T5Fmain highway near Johannesburg.    Tj
OL,13,T5F                                   Tj
OL,14,T5FAnd a black policeman has been     Tj
OL,15,T5Fkilled by gunmen in the township ofTj
OL,16,T5FTembisa.                           Tj
OL,17,T5                                     j
OL,18,T5FLast night at least one house and  Tj
OL,19,T5Fa car were set alight in the black Tj
OL,20,T5Ftownship of Khayelitsa near Cape   Tj
OL,21,T5FTown.                              Tj
