OL,5,T5FNEW DEATHS AS BOSNIANS SPURN TALKS Tj
OL,6,T5GFour people are reported to have   Tj
OL,7,T5Gbeen killed and nine others hurt inTj
OL,8,T5GSerb shelling around Srebrenica.   Tj
OL,9,T5G                                   Tj
OL,10,T5FThe Muslim-led Bosnian army has    Tj
OL,11,T5Fsaid it will not attend Monday's   Tj
OL,12,T5Fkey meeting with the Serb army.    Tj
OL,13,T5F                                   Tj
OL,14,T5FIts leaders have accused Serbs of  Tj
OL,15,T5Fviolating the latest ceasefire     Tj
OL,16,T5Faround blockaded Srebrenica.       Tj
OL,17,T5F                                   Tj
OL,18,T5FThey say they will not attend talksTj
OL,19,T5Funless Serbs stop "combat" at leastTj
OL,20,T5F24 hours before any pre-arranged   Tj
OL,21,T5Fmeeting.                           Tj
