OL,5,T5FSCOTTISH TOURIST MURDERED IN US    Tj
OL,6,T5GA Scottish tourist has been        Tj
OL,7,T5Gmurdered while on holiday in the   Tj
OL,8,T5GUnited States.                     Tj
OL,9,T5G                                   Tj
OL,10,T5FAdrian Strasser, 36, who was a     Tj
OL,11,T5Fteacher at Tower bank primary      Tj
OL,12,T5Fschool in Edinburgh, was found     Tj
OL,13,T5Fbeaten to death yesterday morning  Tj
OL,14,T5Fin New Orleans.                    Tj
OL,15,T5F                                   Tj
OL,16,T5FPolice said it was a particularly  Tj
OL,17,T5Fbrutal attack.                     Tj
OL,18,T5F                                   Tj
OL,19,T5FHe had been on holiday with his    Tj
OL,20,T5Ffiance.                            Tj
